# North Star

The long-term objective is not to build another AI assistant.

The objective is to build an AI-native Engineering Operating System.

Athena becomes the interface.

AEOS becomes the intelligence layer.

Eventually Athena should be capable of:

- understanding projects
- understanding architecture
- understanding codebases
- reviewing pull requests
- generating documentation
- reasoning about APIs
- executing engineering workflows
- managing engineering knowledge
- assisting trading decisions
- coordinating multiple AI agents
- continuously improving from usage

Every engineering capability becomes a reusable AI skill.

Every AI skill becomes part of AEOS.

Every improvement makes Athena more capable.

The final destination is not autonomous coding.

The final destination is autonomous engineering.